# K-Beauty lane

This repo is shared with K-pop and Guide. In the **K-Beauty** chat, edit only this vertical.

## Own these files

- Hub: `kbeauty.html`, `kbeauty-data.js`, `modules/kbeauty.js`, `modules/kbeauty-sharecard.js`
- Overlays: `assets/kbeauty-content.<lang>.json` (14 langs)
- Library: `kb/**` via `node build-kbeauty-pages.cjs` (do not hand-edit generated HTML)
- Live URL: `https://koreaplus-lifes.com/kbeauty` (Worker proxies `/guide/kbeauty.html`)

## Do not

- Edit `kpop.html`, `kpop/`, `index.html` travel chrome, or run `.\deploy-to-guide.ps1` (ships other sessions' WIP)
- Invent medical claims, doctor names, or exact sales numbers
- Re-enable affiliates (`AFFILIATE_ON`) unless the user asks
- Set `document.dir=rtl` globally for Arabic (scope RTL to K-Beauty containers only)

## After JS/CSS/overlay edits, bump together

1. `kbeauty.html` `?v=N` (`kbeauty.js`, `kbeauty-data.js`)
2. `OVERLAY_VER` in `modules/kbeauty.js` if overlays changed
3. `sw.js` `CACHE = kp-vNN` only when this session also deploys `sw.js`

## Deploy

- Hub: `.\deploy-kbeauty-app.ps1`
- Library: `bash deploy-kbeauty.sh`
- Worker (only if `src/` K-Beauty routes changed): unset `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN`, then `npx wrangler deploy` (account `jeybeeicon@gmail.com`). Or `.\deploy-kbeauty-app.ps1 -Worker`
